sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Agent as Node Agent
    participant API as Control API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant XDP as eBPF Maps

    Agent->>API: POST /v1/agents/register
    API->>DB: upsert agent and interfaces in active tenant
    API-->>Agent: agent_id, desired_policy_version
    loop every 5s
        Agent->>API: POST /v1/agents/{id}/heartbeat
        API->>DB: update status, interfaces, active version
        API-->>Agent: desired_policy_version
        alt desired version is newer
            Agent->>API: GET /v1/agents/{id}/snapshot?active_version=n
            API->>DB: read latest tenant snapshot
            API-->>Agent: snapshot
            Agent->>XDP: verify, populate inactive maps, flip slot
            Agent->>API: POST /v1/agents/{id}/apply
            API->>DB: record apply status
        end
    end
